y-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:48782db22a5efd0b8ce20ced81e5441afaac0fdc4262fbefaea5d125985db9a8","file":"preprints/Critical-strip-crossing-mass-on-the-honeycomb-lattice-September-26-2026/build/sections/01_introduction.tex","line":54,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"f344888cb494cb49f962ac59c72f3c0e74212546a5899a5433ea3f1dc3698841","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Critical-strip-crossing-mass-on-the-honeycomb-lattice-September-26-2026/build/sections/01_introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:48782db22a5efd0b8ce20ced81e5441afaac0fdc4262fbefaea5d125985db9a8","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Critical-strip-crossing-mass-on-the-honeycomb-lattice-September-26-2026/build/sections/01_introduction.tex#L54"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:strip}\nFor every integer $N\\ge1$, all sums in\n\\eqref{eq:01-strip-quantities} are finite. With constants independent of\n$N$,\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:01-strip-result}\n c\\mathcal A_N+\\mathcal B_N=1,\\qquad\n m_{N+1}-m_N\\asymp\\mathcal B_N,\\qquad\n m_N\\asymp N^{3/4},\\qquad\n \\mathcal B_N\\asymp N^{-1/4}.\n\\end{equation}\nMoreover, $\\mathcal B_N$ is nonincreasing in $N$."}
